  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The award enhance humanitarian logistics: strengthening preparedness and collaboration for effective response - signal. : the proposed activities aim to strengthen humanitarian response systems by training and engaging key stakeholders, facilitating coordination through participation in meetings and collaboration with ocha and the logistics cluster, leading to improved logistics resilience, enhanced risk analysis integration into national emergency response plans, and a proactive approach towards joint humanitarian logistics response.</narrative>
  </description>
